  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Loi",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Loi.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Duncan Loi (MED0001929347) completed his medical degree at Monash University in Melbourne. He has worked in several hospitals across Melbourne and Sydney, before commencing a career in general practice. He is passionate about all areas of general practice, with particular interest in preventative health, musculoskeletal injuries, dermatology and skin cancer medicine, and chronic disease management.",
      "In his spare time, he enjoys hiking and reading."
    ]
